{
  "$schema": "https://packageurl.org/schemas/purl-test.schema-0.1.json",
  "description": "Spice Labs synthetic per-type namespace-rule vectors (NOT vendored from purl-spec). One parse case per type that isolates the namespace required/prohibited rule, so cross-impl rule-table drift is caught by the shared conformance suite. Derived from each type definition's namespace requirement: 14 required + 17 prohibited.",
